A submix as a sidechain source (Segno: docs/design/groups.md §7.5, §15).

An audio track that a plugin's or a modifier's sidechain names sends its sound, after its plugins
and before its mute, on that sidechain's bus (createNodeForAudioTrack). A submix folder track didn't,
so a module listening to a group heard silence. The submix node now sends the same way. A folder
that no sidechain names is unchanged.

